      "updated_at": "2018-09-14T04:08:05Z",
      "body": "JSON Web Tokens seems like a good idea to me. \r\n\r\nIn terms of implementation,  a top level document called `auth.md` would allow us to easily take this in / out of spec without too much issue / easy to add alternative methods. @asadowns can you prepare a PR? This would be good to have for `0.2.0` as it is a breaking change. ",
